*.mshield

# Cached EUR-Lex download used by --check. The parsed corpus (corpus/gdpr_en.jsonl)
# IS committed on purpose: Streamlit Community Cloud deploys the repo as-is and never
# runs the builder, so an uncommitted corpus means the demo boots with nothing indexed.
corpus/.gdpr_en.html

